<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-JAPANESE J-LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAPANESE J-LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>TOKYO, May 4 (Reuter) Results of Japanese J-League soccer</p>
<p>matches on Sunday:</p>
<p> Kashima    0  Kashiwa   4</p>
<p> Osaka C    0  Osaka G   2</p>
<p> Nagoya     0  Iwata     2</p>
<p> Kobe	 0  Urawa     2</p>
<p> Shimizu    2  Ichiara   1</p>
<p> Hiroshima  1  Kyoto     0</p>
<p> Fukuoka    1  Kawasaki  2</p>
</text>
